; The native build of the pure-engine inference runner. js/jsoo builds the same
; source with `(modes js)`.
;
; A directory of its own rather than a file in js/probe: that directory is the
; differential probe, whose contract is "both backends print the same bytes".
; This runner's contract is "the ranking matches the release reference", and the
; two are checked by different commands (`make jsoo.pt2.runtest` vs
; `make jsoo.pt2.run`). Keeping them apart is what stops one being read as
; evidence for the other.
;
; `(modes exe byte)` for the triage reason js/probe/dune gives: js_of_ocaml
; compiles the BYTECODE, so a difference that survives between .bc and .exe is
; ocamlopt's rather than jsoo's.
;
; No [unix] and no [aten]/[ctypes] -- see .ai/js_backends_design.md for the
; check that keeps it that way.

(executable
 (name pt2_run)
 (modes exe byte)
 (modules pt2_run)
 (libraries err_trace infer_report native_interp native_predict pt2))
